@@ Breakout a covariance matrix to a correlation matrix and uncertainties.
@@ ( CV -- u R )
@@
@@ u is a list of uncertainties.
@@ R is a correlation matrix.
@@
@@ This is the inverse of CovarianceMatrixConstruct
«
	→ CV
	«
		@@ Create u.
		CV ⓁToDiagonal
		SquareRoot

		@@ Create uu, the outer product of u with u.
		@@ Transform u into an (n, 1) matrix.
		@@ ( -- u[] )
		Duplicate FromList ToArray 1 ColumnsToMatrix
		@@ ( u[] -- uu[ , ] )
		Duplicate Transpose *

		CV Swap
		« ÷ » ⓁMatrixElementWiseBinaryOperation
	»
»
